# 18. SIMPLIFY WORK WITHOUT LOSING BUSINESS CONTROL

Inspect each workflow and reduce unnecessary steps.

For example:

### Cashier

Avoid:

Product Scan → Open Product Page → Select Product → Confirm → Return to Sale.

Prefer:

Scan → Item Immediately Added → Continue Scanning.

### Receiving Clerk

Avoid manually entering every known product detail.

Prefer:

Open Purchase Order → Scan Delivered Items → Enter/Confirm Quantity → Record Exceptions → Submit Receipt.

### Purchasing Officer

Avoid repetitive supplier and product entry.

Prefer:

Reorder Suggestion → Review Items → Select Supplier → Create PO → Submit for Approval.

### Branch Manager

Avoid searching several modules to find pending approvals.

Prefer:

Role Dashboard → Pending Approvals → Review Details → Approve/Reject.

### CEO

Avoid navigating individual transactions to understand total performance.

Prefer:

Executive Dashboard → Business Overview → Branch/Department Drill-Down.

Never remove necessary approvals, validation or audit records simply to reduce clicks.

